      "writtenOn": "2021-06-02T20:07:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "What would you think about potentially enabling the fault interrupt in general?  Then we\u0027d have an EC log anytime a fault is reported, even if not immediately paired with another interrupt.  I assume the primary downside would be if there\u0027s a chip with a faulty fault which fires too often.",
      "parentUuid": "29a8347d_abccc451",
      "revId": "26043ec1d997483a81e0c8afc6249e02399c6d72",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": false,
