      "writtenOn": "2021-06-05T00:02:29Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Okay, fault status alert always enabled and we\u0027re using the dev caps to determine if we should be reporting this fault.  I don\u0027t think we\u0027d expect the fault set if a device isn\u0027t capable, but this seems like a safe check to have.",
      "parentUuid": "0a2baf94_5f177fa5",
